            <description><![CDATA[<html><body>
<p><b>Testers sign in and go straight in</b></p>
<ul>
<li>In the tester copy of the app, signing in with Apple, Google or email opens the app. No subscribe screen, no purchase. Signed out, you still see the sign-in screen.</li>
<li>Email accounts that still need confirming now show <b>Check your inbox</b>, with <b>I&#x27;ve confirmed, continue</b> and <b>Send the link again</b>.</li>
<li>If your plan can&#x27;t be checked (no internet, or the server isn&#x27;t answering), the app no longer locks you out with the subscribe screen. It keeps your last known plan, or shows <b>Couldn&#x27;t check your plan</b> with <b>Try Again</b> and <b>Sign Out</b>.</li>
<li>While the plan is being checked you see &quot;Checking your plan…&quot; instead of the subscribe screen flashing up.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
]]></description>
