            <description><![CDATA[<html><body>
<p><b>Teleprompter: the Delivery level is yellow</b></p>
<ul>
<li>On the Delivery level, the pause and section chips, the section bar, the line beside the reading band and the voice-follow pill are now the Teleprompter yellow instead of blue, the same as on the iPhone. Time stays green and Smart stays purple.</li>
<li>Nothing else changes in how the teleprompter works.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
]]></description>
