            <description><![CDATA[<html><body>
<p><b>A small fix to the Collage door</b></p>
<ul>
<li>On Images, if you clicked <b>Collage</b>, cancelled, and then clicked <b>Photo</b>, the new Photo still came with the three-photo layout. Photo now always starts with one photo.</li>
<li>Behind the scenes, every door on the library pages (Record, Import, With script, Photo, Collage, New, Paste) is now checked automatically each time the app is tested.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
]]></description>
